# Keeps the build context to the sources cargo actually needs.
#
# Without this, a local `target/` of several gigabytes is uploaded to the daemon
# on every build, and on this repo that is slower than the compile. The image
# builds its own target/ inside the builder stage, so a host one is never wanted.
target/
.git/
.github/

# Benchmark output and the downloaded tokenizer are mounted or written at run
# time, so they have no business in the image.
results/
.cache/

.env
*.md
!crates/**/*.md
automated_docs/
scripts/
Makefile
compose.yaml
deploy/
